Version B of the reference evals (evals/README.md, "Reference evals"): the
edits that remove every line pointing to the 25 role references shipped in
v0.15.0. `pnpm evals references build-b` removes skills/*/references/ from the
v0.15.0 tree and applies this patch. Git ignores this text above the first
diff. If you change the patch, run `pnpm evals references build-b --check`: it
prints the new commit hash to put in EXPECTED_SHA in
evals/harness/references/build-b.mjs.

